WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.620
Hi, I'm Clara from MyKavo.

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:04.380
Here's something every website owner

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.820
learns the hard way.

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:08.260
Websites rarely break with a bang.

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:09.980
A plugin updates overnight,

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.740
your Add to cart button quietly

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.700
disappears, and nobody notices…

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.380
until sales drop.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.780
That's exactly what MyKavo is for.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:20.700
You add your website, and MyKavo takes

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:22.540
a baseline of your key pages:

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:24.740
how they look, their SEO tags,

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:26.700
links, scripts, and the buttons that

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:27.660
make you money.

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:29.553
Then it keeps checking them.

00:00:29.573 --> 00:00:31.340
And with Safe Updates, it checks right

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:33.700
after every plugin, theme or WordPress

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:34.647
update, too.

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.100
When something important changes,

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:38.060
you get one clear alert:

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.740
what changed, on which page,

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:41.420
and which update caused it.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.260
On WordPress, you can even roll a bad

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:45.180
update back in one click.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.500
So install the free MyKavo plugin,

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:50.060
or start free at mykavo.app.

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:51.260
Know what changed.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:53.240
Fix what matters.
